desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "java"
	title: "检测 Java Cookie HttpOnly 关闭"
	title_zh: "检测 Java Cookie HttpOnly 关闭"
	type: vuln
	level: medium
	rule_id: "source-java-cookie-httponly-false"
	risk: "cookie-security"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 setHttpOnly(false)，会话 Cookie 可被脚本读取。

### 风险类型
cookie-security

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学配置，可能被用于绕过校验、执行代码或泄露机密。

### 检测方式
源码模式正则匹配，定位源码中的危险调用或配置。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
对会话 Cookie 调用 setHttpOnly(true)。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://C.java": <<<POS
import javax.servlet.http.Cookie;
class C {
  void bad(Cookie c) { c.setHttpOnly(false); }
}

POS
	"safefile://S.java": <<<NEG
import javax.servlet.http.Cookie;
class S {
  void ok(Cookie c) { c.setHttpOnly(true); }
}

NEG
)

${*.java}.pattern_regex(/setHttpOnly\s*\(\s*false\s*\)/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "medium",
	title: "检测 Java Cookie HttpOnly 关闭",
	title_zh: "检测 Java Cookie HttpOnly 关闭",
	message: "检测 Java Cookie HttpOnly 关闭",
	risk: "cookie-security",
}
